# NOTE: these two patterns were meant for uppercase SALTO SDK folders, but on
# case-insensitive filesystems (Windows/macOS) they also swallow the real
# Flutter `android/` and `ios/` source trees — so we explicitly re-include them.
# Secrets and build artifacts stay ignored via android/.gitignore and the rules
# above (*.jks, key.properties, *.log, *.iml, /build/, etc.).
/Android/
!/android/
/android/build/
/iOS/
!/ios/
!/ios/Runner/
!/ios/Runner/Runner.entitlements
docs/Jas_Wallet Doc.docx
.claude
.understand-anything
docs/DEV_ENVIRONMENT.md
docs/OPS_DASHBOARD_MVP.md